@osr21 All three addressed, commit [`8f492fe`](https://github.com/giskard09/checkpoint-producer-binding-ref-anchor/commit/8f492fef322bed9f66a574aff4435cc8b2fa1f89):

- `recheck_inclusion()` now returns `{status, checked_at, chain_id, block, block_hash}` instead of a bare string.
